  "world": {
    "_about": "The Night shop kit (task Д3, D61, D64, D106). colors: the code placeholders of the kit and darkness, the colour the dark room multiplies everything by (CanvasModulate). textures: a Gemini picture per piece, res:// path, empty draws the code placeholder; brick, masonry, floor_top and concrete_top repeat as tiles (floor_top: the top face strip on top, top_face_px of it, then the iron edge and masonry), the others stretch over the piece's rect. brick_px: one brick of the placeholder wall; masonry_px and concrete_px: one block of the masonry and concrete placeholders, each dividing 256 (D112: the kit is sized to the heroine, 92 px = 1.75 m, about 52 px a metre; docs/art/scale.md). top_face_px: the visible top face of floors and ledges, her feet on its middle (collision unchanged). edge_px: the iron angle along the sides and lower faces of solid cells. machine_dim: background machines are this much darker than the wall pieces. lamp: every lamp of a layout (lamps in levels.json): the warm colour and energy of its light, radius_px of the island, below_px how far below the bulb the island's centre lies, flicker depth (0..1) and flicker_hz, a formula of world time; halo_px and halo_alpha: the soft glow round the bulb. heroine_light: a weak light that lights only the heroine, so she reads between the islands (D76).",
